  "summary": "RGB Gamer describes the design trends and subculture surrounding the video gamer community in the 2020s .",
  "description": "RGB Gamer describes the design trends and subculture surrounding the video gamer community in the 2020s . With the increasing popularity of gaming as a subculture, as well as the rise of e-sports [ 1 ] , PC-building, and Twitch streaming, the culture is increasingly streamlined and has more professional appeal. This interpretation of gaming is also the default gamer image, at least currently.\n\nThe major component of this aesthetic is the design of gaming-related products made by companies for electronics and furniture. These designs emphasize sleekness and a certain color palette.",
